tomic.q scan + edge-side bbox containment or haversine radius (distance_m ranking); exactly one of bbox|near required.\"}, :invariants [\"No new pod surface, storage, or auth model -- everything compiles onto the existing datomic.* plane\" \"Ingest reuses proxy/authorize-tenant-cap-write unchanged (client graph CID cannot override ownership)\" \"Generated Datalog is data-patterns-only; pod predicate/fulltext push-down is a follow-up lift (kotoba-datomic support unverified); the candidates response field makes the 1000-row recall cap observable\" \"Clojure stays schema authority: webpages/places join kotobase.schema well-known; :webpage/url and :place/id are :db.unique/identity; datomic.listDatabases advertises 4 graphs\"], :artifacts [\"clj-edge/src/kotobase/{web,geo,rows,domain_search}.cljc (pure cores + cljs route glue)\" \"contracts/lexicons/ai/gftd/apps/kotobase/{web,geo}/{ingest,search}.json\" \"worker/test/web_geo_search_test.cljc (against the rebuilt committed bundle, 8/8)\" \"docs/adr/2607072330-web-geo-datalog-search.md (in-repo detail)\"]}", :db/id -1, :adr/landing "{:repo \"gftdcojp/net-kotobase\", :branch \"feat/web-geo-datalog-search\", :merge_sha \"67b8f6d8058e3b2fd8fa3f394e949d0b443a1ffa\", :merge_path \"gh api repos/gftdcojp/net-kotobase/merges (server-side, no local merge/rebase/force-push)\", :west_pin {:entry \"net-kotobase\", :from \"ad0397dcf24d3b5e084e944ffe4d726ae2002990\", :to \"67b8f6d8058e3b2fd8fa3f394e949d0b443a1ffa\", :path \"GitHub API single-entry commit on manifest/west.yml\"}}", :adr/problem "{:source \"オーナー指示 2026-07-07: 「では設計実装してください. maps, search なども datomic 系をベースに.」\", :facts [\"net-kotobase had datomic.*/graph.*/kg.* query families but zero\\n    webpage-search or maps surface (verified 2026-07-07 against lexicons,\\n    worker routes, and docs).\" \"kg.search is ontology/entity-shaped (OWL classes, embeddings), not a\\n    page or place surface.\"]}", :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "ADR-2607072430: net-kotobase web.*/geo.* 